Exact measurement/global configfs/Kconfig and old mixed test bodies retained
from Kdd11fa38a338. They are historical references, not production includes or
current capability promises. Native measurement needs real capability discovery,
controller/generation/connection identity and validated typed transactions;
legacy defaults/direct submits are rejected before context or usercopy.

configfs publishes only software version. Five removed global nodes must be
ENOENT and cannot create a backend. Actual board firmware/config still belongs
to each WS73 driver (bsle_custom.bin and pm_config.bin remain required).
No-op SPARKLINK_SLE/DEBUGFS options are removed; Linux DEBUG_FS controls debugfs.
Core no longer forces crypto algorithms without a production consumer; actual
WS73 boot SHA256 dependency remains with its driver. Kernel crypto source is
retained for future authenticated per-session mechanisms and fault tests.

Root scratch no-ghost and actual Virtual checks now test absence and registry
invariance. Preserve standard Diagnostic autonomous timeout/cancel/credit and
real two-device qualification; do not revive old success/fallback behavior.
